    "mode": "alternating mirrored pairs",
    "tile_width": 480,
    "pair_width": 960,
    "rule": "For each layer alternate unflipped and horizontally flipped tiles using identical source. Adjacent edge texels then match. World-anchored static tiles; no end caps repeated inside continuous pipe. Water scrolls paired pattern to right under bore clipping. A and B are alternative water textures, not verified morph frames; use A for first integration.",
